### ArtPrompt: test requests for reviewers
### All requests are public (no login) and only read data. Nothing is saved.
### Run a request with the green arrow next to it.
@baseUrl = https://torndalchristensen.dk

### 1. Overview of all routes and roles (HTML page)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/routes

### 2. List of prompt categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prompts/categories

### 3. One random word from each of two categories
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prompts/random?cat1=MOOD&cat2=ANIMALS

### 4. Five random paintings from the catalog
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/paintings/random

### 5. Ten images in a color (YELLOW, RED, BLUE, BLACK, WHITE, GREEN, PURPLE, ORANGE)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/unsplash/color?color=RED

### Error examples

### 6. Invalid category gives 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/prompts/random?cat1=XXX&cat2=YYY

### 7. Invalid color gives 400
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/unsplash/color?color=XXX

### 8. Protected endpoint without a token gives 401
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/images/user/1

### 9. Broken JSON (the body is incomplete on purpose) gives 400
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":